                <pb facs="0349" n="245" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg245"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    65.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 15. The offenses defined in article 325
                    of the fiscal code, or of that which replaces it in the custom-house code, shall
                    be punished as follows:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>In the second and third cases loss (confiscation) of the merchandise and the boat
                    or other vehicles in which the contraband goods may be carried, even though they
                    may not be the property of the defrauders.</p>
            </div>
